flowchart TD
  A["Claim predicted to be denied"] --> B{"What kind of fix?"}
  B -->|"Data fix<br/>D04 modifier, D07 missing auth no.,<br/>D09 units above EVV, typos"| C["Autofix agent proposes edit<br/>using values from existing records only"]
  C --> D{{"Biller reviews the diff"}}
  D -->|approve| E["Claim updated, re-checked"]
  D -->|reject| F["Biller edits manually"]
  E --> G["Submit, frequency code 1"]
  B -->|"Process fix<br/>D01 EVV not verified,<br/>D02 auth used up, D08 wrong / expired auth"| H["Route to the right person<br/>coordinator: fix EVV record<br/>auth team: request new auth"]
  H --> I["Claim held until resolved,<br/>then re-checked"]
  B -->|"Not fixable<br/>D03 past filing limit, D05 true duplicate"| J["Flag: write off, appeal,<br/>or drop duplicate"]

  K["Guardrail: agent may never invent an<br/>auth number or raise units"] -.- C

